Salesforce Executor
===================

This repository is a private fork of the open-source Executor project:

  Project:   Executor
  Upstream:  https://github.com/RhysSullivan/executor
  License:   MIT (see LICENSE)
  Copyright: (c) 2026 Rhys Sullivan

The Salesforce Executor fork is licensed under the same MIT terms.

Snapshot baseline
-----------------

The current upstream snapshot point is recorded in [UPSTREAM_BASE](./UPSTREAM_BASE).
The fork is a content snapshot rather than a true git fork (the fork's root
commit has no shared ancestor with upstream). To re-sync, see
`scripts/sync-upstream.sh`.

Upstream-originated packages vendored in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------

The following workspace packages originate upstream and are kept as private
(`"private": true`) — they are not published from this fork:

  packages/core/cli                 (@executor-js/cli)
  packages/core/config              (@executor-js/config)
  packages/core/execution           (@executor-js/execution)
  packages/core/sdk                 (@executor-js/sdk)
  packages/core/storage-core        (@executor-js/storage-core)
  packages/core/vite-plugin         (@executor-js/vite-plugin)
  packages/kernel/core              (@executor-js/codemode-core)
  packages/kernel/runtime-quickjs   (@executor-js/runtime-quickjs)
  packages/plugins/example          (@executor-js/plugin-example)
  packages/plugins/file-secrets     (@executor-js/plugin-file-secrets)
  packages/plugins/google-discovery (@executor-js/plugin-google-discovery)
  packages/plugins/graphql          (@executor-js/plugin-graphql)
  packages/plugins/keychain         (@executor-js/plugin-keychain)
  packages/plugins/mcp              (@executor-js/plugin-mcp)
  packages/plugins/onepassword      (@executor-js/plugin-onepassword)
  packages/plugins/openapi          (@executor-js/plugin-openapi)
  packages/plugins/workos-vault     (@executor-js/plugin-workos-vault)

  apps/cloud         (@executor-js/cloud)
  apps/desktop       (@executor-js/desktop)
  apps/marketing     (@executor-js/marketing)
  apps/local         (@executor-js/local)

Each carries its own `README.md` linking back to the upstream tree path,
and `package.json#repository` points at this fork while still attributing
upstream via `NOTICE` and `LICENSE`.

Salesforce-overlay packages
---------------------------

The following packages and apps were added by the Salesforce Executor fork
and are not present upstream:

  packages/salesforce-docs-index    (@salesforce-executor/docs-index)
  apps/cli/src/cli/salesforce       (Salesforce setup/doctor CLI library)
  adapters/cli-bridge               (CLI bridge stdio MCP adapter)
  adapters/informatica-idmc         (Informatica IDMC stdio MCP adapter)
  scripts/salesforce/*              (bun wrappers around the CLI library)
  scripts/run-data360-mcp.{sh,mjs}  (Data 360 MCP launcher)
  skills/salesforce-*               (Codex skill pack for Salesforce-family tools)

